# Loaded automatically by Vite for production builds (`npm run build`).
#
# "/api" is a same-origin relative path. The bundled nginx (see nginx.conf)
# reverse-proxies /api/* to the backend, so the browser never makes a
# cross-site request — the JWT cookie stays first-party and no CORS is needed.
#
# If instead you host the backend on a SEPARATE domain, set this to the full
# HTTPS URL (e.g. https://api.yourdomain.com) and configure CORS + SameSite=None.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
